  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism: two staggered rows of high dorsal plates and four tail spikes. [\"Soft tissue, colour, keratin thickness and exact mounted posture are reconstructions.\", \"Left arm and tail base incompleteness require symmetry/comparative reconstruction; sex is unknown despite nickname Sophie.\", \"Plate exact lateral tilt and tail spike angle are artistic approximations, not new osteological measurements.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 5.5, \"basis\": \"NHM specimen interview: just over5.5m; use approximate5.5m reconstruction, not genus9m maximum.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism: two staggered rows of high dorsal plates and four tail spikes. [\"Soft tissue, colour, keratin thickness and exact mounted posture are reconstructions.\", \"Left arm and tail base incompleteness require symmetry/comparative reconstruction; sex is unknown despite nickname Sophie.\", \"Plate exact lateral tilt and tail spike angle are artistic approximations, not new osteological measurements.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 5.5, \"basis\": \"NHM specimen interview: just over5.5m; use approximate5.5m reconstruction, not genus9m maximum.\"}"
  },
